# Minimize the Docker build context. The Dockerfile only needs go.mod,
# go.sum, the root *.go files, internal/, the license files the image ships
# under /usr/share/licenses, and the collector that builds that tree. Deny
# everything, then allow the build inputs back in so the gitignored
# .code-review/ review scratch, .git/, tests/, and docs never reach the daemon.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!internal/
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!scripts/collect-licenses.sh
# go build never compiles tests; keep test-only edits from invalidating build layers
**/*_test.go
